":39},{"text":"좀","x":1604,"y":1995,"width":37,"height":37},{"text":"더","x":1660,"y":1993,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"포괄적인","x":1710,"y":1993,"width":134,"height":39}]},{"text":"내펑은 3.7절 참조). 타이머 만료는 주로 네트워크에서의 혼잡에 의해 발생한다. 즉, 출","words":[{"text":"내펑은","x":520,"y":2056,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"3.7절","x":634,"y":2058,"width":81,"height":37},{"text":"참조).","x":730,"y":2058,"width":87,"height":39},{"text":"타이머","x":832,"y":2058,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"만료는","x":946,"y":2059,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"주로","x":1058,"y":2059,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크에서의","x":1140,"y":2057,"width":235,"height":39},{"text":"혼잡에","x":1390,"y":2057,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"의해","x":1510,"y":2056,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"발생한다.","x":1592,"y":2056,"width":150,"height":39},{"text":"즉,","x":1758,"y":2058,"width":42,"height":37},{"text":"출","x":1813,"y":2057,"width":33,"height":37}]},{"text":"발지와 목적지 사이의 경로에서 하나 이상의 라우터 큐에 도착한 많은 패킷은 패킷의","words":[{"text":"발지와","x":520,"y":2117,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"목적지","x":637,"y":2119,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"사이의","x":754,"y":2119,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"경로에서","x":871,"y":2120,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"하나","x":1018,"y":2119,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"이상의","x":1100,"y":2119,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"라우터","x":1216,"y":2119,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"큐에","x":1331,"y":2119,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"도착한","x":1415,"y":2118,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"많은","x":1537,"y":2119,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"패킷은","x":1624,"y":2118,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"패킷의","x":1747,"y":2118,"width":95,"height":39}]},{"text":"손실이나 오랜 큐 대기의 원인이 된다. 혼잡할 때 출발지에서 지속적으로 패킷의 재전","words":[{"text":"손실이나","x":518,"y":2179,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"오랜","x":670,"y":2181,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"큐","x":752,"y":2183,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"대기의","x":800,"y":2181,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"원인이","x":915,"y":2180,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"된다.","x":1028,"y":2181,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡할","x":1117,"y":2181,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"때","x":1233,"y":2181,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"출발지에서","x":1279,"y":2181,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"지속적으로","x":1467,"y":2181,"width":178,"height":38},{"text":"패킷의","x":1661,"y":2181,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"재전","x":1782,"y":2181,"width":62,"height":37}]},{"text":"송을 고집하면 그 혼잡은 더욱 악화될 것이다. 대신에 TCP는 송신자가 더 긴 간격으로","words":[{"text":"송을","x":518,"y":2241,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"고집하면","x":600,"y":2242,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":749,"y":2248,"width":34,"height":25},{"text":"혼잡은","x":795,"y":2242,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"더욱","x":909,"y":2242,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"악화될","x":988,"y":2241,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":1101,"y":2241,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"대신에","x":1223,"y":2242,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"TCP는","x":1335,"y":2245,"width":109,"height":35},{"text":"송신자가","x":1455,"y":2242,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"더","x":1613,"y":2243,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"긴","x":1663,"y":2243,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"간격으로","x":1710,"y":2243,"width":136,"height":38}]},{"text":"재전송하도록 한다. 6장에서 CSMA/CD를 공부할 때, 이더넷이 이와 유사한 개념을","words":[{"text":"재전송하도록","x":520,"y":2302,"width":206,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":742,"y":2302,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"6장에서","x":834,"y":2303,"width":116,"height":38},{"text":"CSMA/CD를","x":970,"y":2304,"width":207,"height":35},{"text":"공부할","x":1193,"y":2304,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"때,","x":1312,"y":2304,"width":40,"height":38},{"text":"이더넷이","x":1373,"y":2304,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"이와","x":1531,"y":2305,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"유사한","x":1618,"y":2305,"width":112,"height":39},{"text":"개념을","x":1747,"y":2304,"width":100,"height":40}]},{"text":"사용하게 되는 것을 보게 될 것이다.","words":[{"text":"사용하게","x":519,"y":2363,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"되는","x":670,"y":2364,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":